      "markdown": "## Install Live\n\nOpen Plugins → Live → Settings. Prepare the stream encoder and the four required H3 files, then start ComfyUI and re-check. Turbo is optional. The plugin reuses compatible files already on disk. ComfyUI node packs run in ComfyUI and require a restart after installation.\n\nKeep Live stopped before disabling the plugin or restarting ComfyUI. Rendering uses local ComfyUI."
